 {
  "title": "国务院关于《辽宁省国土空间规划（2021—2035年）》的批复",
  "url": "https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202404/content_6943413.htm",
  "source": "国务院",
  "date": "2024-04-03",
  "category": "policy",
  "department": "自然资源",
